The gate requires a conciseness pass rate of at least 0.80 and a keyword-hit rate no more than 0.02 below baseline 0.78. Either failure must stop the pipeline. The evaluation below returns m = {'is_concise/mean': 0.75, 'keyword_hit/mean': 0.77}. Which condition correctly stops this candidate?

```python
@scorer
def is_concise(outputs: str) -> bool:
    return len(outputs.split()) <= 5

@scorer
def keyword_hit(outputs: str, expectations: dict) -> float:
    return 1.0 if expectations["expected_response"] in outputs else 0.0

res = mlflow.genai.evaluate(data=data, predict_fn=answer, scorers=[is_concise, keyword_hit])
m = res.metrics
```

